# Get a workout. Start the API with Aspire first. Fill in the IDs from a workout in progress: start one with CreateWorkout.http.
@host = http://localhost:5279
@accessToken = paste-an-access-token
@workoutId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@workoutExerciseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@setId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### A workout → 200, or 404 workout.not_found.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/workouts/{{workoutId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Not signed in → 401 unauthorized.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/workouts/{{workoutId}}
